<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<LanguageData>
<!--=============== Quest - Hunted Messenger ====================-->
<!--=============== NameRules ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <li>questName->拯救[askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->帮助[askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->[askerAdj][askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->[askerIndef]被[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]追捕</li>
  <li>questName->[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]狩猎[askerIndef]</li>
  <li>questName->追逐的阴影</li>
  <!-- Pieces -->
  <li>askerAdj->被猎杀的</li>
  <li>askerAdj->最后的</li>
  <li>askerAdj->逃亡的</li>
  <li>askerAdj->被伏击的</li>
  <li>askerIndef->信使</li>
  <li>askerIndef->信差</li>
  <li>askerIndef->幸存</li>
  <li>askerIndef->[asker_nameFull]</li>
  <li>askerIndef->[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]</li>
</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.questNameRules.rulesStrings>

<!--=============== DescriptionRules ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]的[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]，勉强逃脱了伏击。[asker_possessive]护卫被屠杀，现在[asker_pronoun]正在被猎杀。[asker_nameDef]需要你的帮助，在穿梭机到达前几个小时内在[map_definite]隐藏。作为回报，[asker_pronoun]承诺奖励[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]。\n敌方[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]过于激动，无法提供更多信息。</li>
  <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]最幸运的[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]，设法从一场致命的伏击中逃脱，但失去了所有[asker_possessive]护卫。现在，[asker_pronoun]正在被追捕，需要一个英雄（或者至少是能站几个小时的人）。如果你能在穿梭机到达前保护[asker_objective]在[map_definite]的安全，你将获得[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]。\n敌方[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]过于激动，无法提供更多信息。</li>
  <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，一个破碎而绝望的[asker_faction_name]的[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]，从夺走[asker_possessive]护卫的屠杀中逃离。独自一人，被猎杀，被倒下的哀嚎所困扰，[asker_pronoun]寻求庇护。追逐还没有结束——敌人正在逼近。在穿梭机到来之前，在[map_definite]庇护[asker_nameDef]，作为交换，你将获得[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]。\n敌方[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]过于激动，无法提供更多信息。</li>
</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>

<!--=============== Roots ====================-->
<!--=============== Raid arrives ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>{BASELABEL}正在追捕[../asker_nameDef]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>{BASETEXT}\n\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]前来抓捕[../asker_nameDef]。</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>
<!--=============== Shuttle ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.InspectString.inspectString.slateRef>应乘坐穿梭机离开</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.InspectString.inspectString.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>穿梭机已到达</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>穿梭机已到达接[asker_nameDef]。</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.ShuttleDelay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Asker died ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客死亡：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已经死亡。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Surgery Violation ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>未经授权的手术：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>对被你委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}进行了未经授权、违反规定的手术。由于此违规行为，[asker_pronoun]现在将尝试离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Lodger's xenogerm absorbed ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>异种胚芽被吸收：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}的异种胚芽被强行吸收了。由于此违规行为，{SUBJECT_pronoun}现在将尝试离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Lodger arrested ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>被俘虏：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托接待的{SUBJECT_definite}已被逮捕。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Asker left map ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客丢失：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已离开指定定居点。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Lodger ran wild ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>访客丢失：{SUBJECT_definite}</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}已失控。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.askerRanWild.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Shuttle destroyed ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>穿梭机被摧毁</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef> 
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>派来接[asker_nameDef]的穿梭机已被摧毁。[asker_pronoun]现在将步行离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
<!--=============== Shuttle sent ====================-->
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务失败：[resolvedQuestName]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
<OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>派来接[asker_nameDef]的穿梭机在没有[asker_objective]的情况下离开了。[asker_pronoun]现在将步行离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedMessenger.root.nodes.pickupShipThingSentUnsatisfied.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>

</LanguageData>